WEBVTT

01:41.740 --> 01:49.030
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.470 --> 01:51.900
[Episode 17]

01:56.000 --> 01:57.259
What's wrong, bro? Tired?

01:57.259 --> 01:57.870
Yes.

01:59.210 --> 02:00.140
Let's take a taxi back.

02:00.140 --> 02:01.670
Tired after just this much?

02:01.980 --> 02:03.400
Hey, I have to say,

02:03.400 --> 02:05.680
it's really a beautiful sunny day.

02:07.010 --> 02:07.400
Yeah.

02:07.400 --> 02:08.199
So beautiful.

02:09.750 --> 02:11.280
Shen Fuxuan's so annoying,

02:11.310 --> 02:12.750
suddenly uncontactable.

02:12.750 --> 02:14.360
He just ditched us like that.

02:14.620 --> 02:15.800
Right, so disloyal.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.520
With all these bags and bundles,
we could really

02:17.520 --> 02:19.240
use a pair of strong hands right now.

02:19.240 --> 02:20.500
We brought too many snacks.

02:20.290 --> 02:24.690
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

02:20.500 --> 02:21.960
Let's eat them up quickly.

02:22.020 --> 02:23.190
Don't worry with Duan Qiyan here.

02:23.190 --> 02:24.030
They'll be gone in no time.

02:24.030 --> 02:24.890
Give me a break.

02:25.000 --> 02:26.190
What's wrong with you two?

02:25.640 --> 02:29.550
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

02:26.190 --> 02:27.960
Not helping the girls

02:27.960 --> 02:28.910
carry anything?

02:30.590 --> 02:31.240
Give it to me.

02:31.160 --> 02:37.740
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer ♪

02:31.370 --> 02:31.860
Thanks.

02:31.860 --> 02:32.590
Give it to me.

02:33.680 --> 02:35.150
Layer up when going up the mountain later.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.079
It's cold there.

02:36.180 --> 02:36.590
Okay.

02:36.780 --> 02:37.310
Alright.

02:41.730 --> 02:45.820
♪ Sometimes I wonder
if I should back down ♪

02:43.710 --> 02:44.630
Hurry up!

02:44.630 --> 02:46.000
Hurry, hurry.

02:47.060 --> 02:51.120
♪ Sudden alienation between us
is what scares me the most ♪

02:52.460 --> 02:59.030
♪ How can two hearts beat as one
and truly feel each other? ♪

03:03.360 --> 03:07.280
♪ The meteors fly past,
silencing thoughts ♪

03:09.140 --> 03:12.820
♪ Please, give me some clues ♪

03:13.840 --> 03:20.579
♪ I hope you can see through
my situation and confusion ♪

03:21.590 --> 03:24.320
♪ And save me ♪

03:24.690 --> 03:29.930
♪ Can you hear me? Why won't you answer? ♪

03:30.500 --> 03:33.840
♪ I'm calling you secretly at night ♪

03:35.070 --> 03:40.400
♪ The moon whispers
fond words by my ears ♪

03:41.120 --> 03:46.020
♪ It asks if you're still there
through ups and downs ♪

03:41.780 --> 03:43.360
3, 2, 1.

03:43.650 --> 03:44.400
Turn it on!

03:46.340 --> 03:51.230
♪ Am I lying? I answer my own questions ♪

03:49.190 --> 03:50.150
Nice.

03:51.770 --> 03:56.100
♪ But I've already fallen,
I can't help it, oh ♪

03:54.800 --> 03:56.870
Happy graduation!

03:56.579 --> 04:02.780
♪ Forgive me for being silly
for you and only you ♪

04:02.750 --> 04:04.410
The stars are so bright today.

04:05.010 --> 04:11.850
♪ My desires turn into ocean waves
in my dreams, lapping gently ♪

04:05.430 --> 04:07.630
It'll be even more beautiful tomorrow.

04:07.930 --> 04:09.430
This trip of ours

04:09.870 --> 04:13.190
-is totally worth it!
-He's lost it.

04:23.720 --> 04:24.630
What's wrong?

04:28.450 --> 04:32.050
I was thinking about how
Shen Fuxuan hasn't contacted us all day.

04:32.060 --> 04:34.390
I'm worried if something happened to him.

04:34.500 --> 04:35.600
Don't worry.

04:36.000 --> 04:38.180
He's probably off
having fun by himself.

04:38.180 --> 04:40.270
But why'd he ignore our texts?

04:41.190 --> 04:42.190
Could Shen Fuxuan

04:42.190 --> 04:43.870
have some other reason?

04:43.930 --> 04:45.460
He isn't usually like this.

04:46.750 --> 04:47.560
Actually,

04:48.270 --> 04:49.390
I know the reason.

04:51.250 --> 04:52.650
He contacted me earlier.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.190
He gave me a letter

04:58.930 --> 04:59.750
and said

05:00.370 --> 05:02.750
that if we see a meteor shower,

05:03.430 --> 05:05.720
I should read it to everyone for him.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.870
What meteor shower?

05:07.870 --> 05:08.830
Just read it now.

05:10.010 --> 05:11.000
Read it now?

05:11.000 --> 05:12.190
Go ahead. It's fine.

05:20.430 --> 05:21.630
Hello,

05:22.130 --> 05:23.060
my dear friends.

05:25.600 --> 05:26.510
At this moment,

05:27.070 --> 05:28.800
you must be on the mountain top,

05:28.980 --> 05:30.910
having made wishes while watching

05:31.190 --> 05:32.990
the meteor shower streak across

05:33.250 --> 05:34.380
the vast starry sky.

05:36.270 --> 05:37.270
It's a pity

05:37.360 --> 05:39.870
that I couldn't
spend this moment with you,

05:41.300 --> 05:43.030
because I'm currently abroad,

05:43.430 --> 05:45.310
preparing for the new semester

05:46.500 --> 05:48.230
of a five-year medical program

05:48.690 --> 05:49.890
my parents arranged.

05:51.100 --> 05:52.240
He went abroad?

05:53.890 --> 05:56.390
Shen really kept this secret airtight—

05:56.570 --> 05:57.720
not a peep leaked.

06:01.690 --> 06:02.560
I'm sorry for

06:03.270 --> 06:05.270
not telling you this news in person,

06:05.980 --> 06:07.040
because I really didn't know

06:07.040 --> 06:08.640
how to say goodbye to you all.

06:11.770 --> 06:13.970
I'm used to being on my own my whole life.

06:14.240 --> 06:15.750
Expressing my feelings

06:16.230 --> 06:17.240
is harder for me

06:17.750 --> 06:19.130
than calculus.

06:21.630 --> 06:24.070
So I can only
write these things down here.

06:25.860 --> 06:28.260
You're the ones
I find hardest to part with.

06:28.390 --> 06:29.450
You're the friends

06:30.450 --> 06:32.060
I'll miss the most.

06:34.000 --> 06:35.400
You probably have no idea

06:36.450 --> 06:37.310
how lucky

06:38.040 --> 06:39.330
someone like me feels

06:40.500 --> 06:41.960
to be treated as one of you.

06:43.450 --> 06:46.240
So, thank you

06:47.890 --> 06:50.010
for letting a buzzkill and loner

06:50.300 --> 06:51.120
like me

06:52.040 --> 06:54.180
become a part of your youth.

06:56.130 --> 06:57.530
Being friends with you is

06:57.830 --> 06:59.930
the best thing that's happened to me.

07:02.330 --> 07:03.240
I'm leaving.

07:04.010 --> 07:06.740
Please make a wish
upon a shooting star for me too:

07:06.750 --> 07:08.610
let Shen Fuxuan come back sooner;

07:09.430 --> 07:11.300
don't let him always eat alone;

07:12.540 --> 07:15.920
may our friendship last forever.

07:27.950 --> 07:30.600
Shen really just left like that.

07:34.220 --> 07:35.950
What's with all the long faces?

07:37.310 --> 07:38.720
Communication is so advanced now.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.850
Even if he's abroad,

07:40.100 --> 07:41.830
it's very easy to stay in touch.

07:42.630 --> 07:45.270
Exactly. Being far from home is nice too.

07:45.620 --> 07:47.070
Nobody died.

07:47.570 --> 07:48.270
Yeah.

07:48.870 --> 07:51.390
But since we met Shen,

07:52.000 --> 07:53.159
we've never really

07:53.159 --> 07:54.830
been apart for a long time.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.560
Just thinking about how

07:57.860 --> 08:00.070
we'll be separated soon for a few years

08:00.750 --> 08:02.190
is pretty depressing.

08:15.920 --> 08:18.720
Shen Fuxuan is actually
very suited to be a doctor.

08:19.220 --> 08:20.160
He's rigorous,

08:20.500 --> 08:21.480
conscientious,

08:21.750 --> 08:23.750
calm, and has an inquisitive mind.

08:24.770 --> 08:26.310
He will be a great doctor.

08:29.250 --> 08:30.920
So we should be happy for him.

08:31.390 --> 08:32.080
Exactly.

08:32.860 --> 08:33.720
Don't be sad.

08:35.270 --> 08:37.150
Yeah, don't be sad over nothing.

08:38.820 --> 08:39.549
You babies.

08:39.549 --> 08:40.480
This is nothing.

08:40.980 --> 08:43.080
You're just a year older than us.

08:43.630 --> 08:45.150
But I'm a college student,

08:45.150 --> 08:46.680
and you're high schoolers.

08:47.630 --> 08:49.120
Then Mr. College Student,

08:49.120 --> 08:51.520
tell us what's so different about college.

08:55.220 --> 08:58.750
Once in college,
you'll find that everything changes.

08:59.360 --> 09:01.360
Your horizons will broaden.

09:02.500 --> 09:04.670
And you'll no longer be a kid.

09:05.500 --> 09:07.820
From the moment
you get your acceptance letter,

09:07.820 --> 09:10.200
you'll experience all kinds of goodbyes.

09:12.480 --> 09:15.210
For the first time,
you'll part with your family,

09:15.460 --> 09:17.510
with childhood friends,

09:18.200 --> 09:20.080
and with your familiar hometown.

09:20.080 --> 09:21.720
You'll be in an unfamiliar city,

09:21.720 --> 09:23.480
looking at unfamiliar faces.

09:23.480 --> 09:24.940
You've to face all of this.

09:29.360 --> 09:30.790
Why do we have to grow up?

09:32.130 --> 09:34.390
Why can't we stay together forever?

09:38.910 --> 09:40.670
Growing up is inevitable.

09:41.510 --> 09:42.840
But I think

09:43.030 --> 09:45.160
our friendship can remain unchanged.

09:48.000 --> 09:49.130
As long as we hold on,

09:50.220 --> 09:51.680
we can always be together.

09:55.010 --> 09:55.630
Right.

09:56.630 --> 09:58.230
Don't be afraid of goodbyes.

09:59.410 --> 10:00.870
But learn to cherish

10:01.120 --> 10:02.550
every present moment.

10:07.620 --> 10:08.720
Makes sense.

10:09.220 --> 10:10.120
But...

10:13.620 --> 10:15.600
Don't you think what he just said

10:16.390 --> 10:18.200
sounds a bit like someone?

10:18.870 --> 10:19.510
Like who?

10:22.820 --> 10:23.720
Um, um...

10:23.720 --> 10:25.450
-Director Sui!
-Director Sui!

10:26.120 --> 10:27.750
-Yes, I think so too!
-What? No way.

10:27.750 --> 10:29.280
I was just going to say that.

10:29.510 --> 10:31.640
Impossible, absolutely impossible.

10:32.610 --> 10:36.440
To be honest, it is a bit patronizing.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.630
Come on, let's toast.

10:39.630 --> 10:40.270
Cheers.

10:40.890 --> 10:41.870
To Shen Fuxuan.

10:41.890 --> 10:43.770
-Shen Fuxuan, you've got this!
-To Shen Fuxuan!

10:43.770 --> 10:44.750
Go for it!

10:54.080 --> 10:54.670
Zeqiu,

10:54.960 --> 10:56.600
look how bright that star is.

10:58.980 --> 11:00.510
Which one's the brightest?

11:00.980 --> 11:02.670
I think that one's very bright.

11:02.670 --> 11:03.750
That one's bright too.

11:03.750 --> 11:04.860
That star...

11:55.270 --> 11:56.320
You're awake too.

12:01.220 --> 12:02.150
Do you want to

12:02.790 --> 12:03.670
go for a walk?

12:14.010 --> 12:15.320
Why are you still up?

12:16.600 --> 12:17.440
Can't sleep?

12:19.250 --> 12:20.240
Not exactly.

12:21.030 --> 12:22.630
I'm just excited about

12:23.120 --> 12:24.380
camping with friends.

12:24.870 --> 12:26.870
What about you? Why can't you sleep?

12:27.320 --> 12:28.520
I was drawing comics.

12:29.120 --> 12:30.050
Drawing comics?

12:33.530 --> 12:35.630
I'm recording every
important moment of ours

12:35.630 --> 12:37.200
in comics.

12:38.410 --> 12:40.340
I'll show you when I get the chance.

12:50.390 --> 12:51.550
What's that,

12:52.150 --> 12:53.150
that green thing?

12:53.250 --> 12:54.080
Where?

12:54.290 --> 12:55.120
There.

12:56.750 --> 12:57.390
This one?

13:09.770 --> 13:11.030
It's so pretty.

13:11.910 --> 13:13.310
It looks like an emerald.

13:14.290 --> 13:15.480
Any stone in your hands

13:15.480 --> 13:16.670
would become a gem.

13:19.620 --> 13:21.790
It must've been polished over time

13:22.150 --> 13:23.750
to have such a perfect shape.

13:25.870 --> 13:26.510
For you.

13:29.820 --> 13:30.750
Why give it to me?

13:31.370 --> 13:32.470
Because I want to.

13:36.170 --> 13:37.270
If you don't want it,

13:37.270 --> 13:38.440
give it back.

13:38.770 --> 13:40.570
I'll ask if anyone else wants it.

13:40.980 --> 13:42.040
Of course I want it.

13:50.170 --> 13:51.700
Are you feeling better now?

13:56.150 --> 13:59.320
I'm just a bit sad
that I didn't get to say goodbye

13:59.670 --> 14:01.070
to Shen Fuxuan in person.

14:04.720 --> 14:05.670
What if

14:06.530 --> 14:08.480
it was Duan Qiyan or someone else

14:08.650 --> 14:09.710
who left this time?

14:10.460 --> 14:11.480
I'd feel the same.

14:11.650 --> 14:13.120
We're all buddies.

14:15.510 --> 14:16.550
What if it was me?

14:23.290 --> 14:24.350
You're different.

14:27.700 --> 14:30.150
Aren't... Aren't we all buddies?

14:34.200 --> 14:36.460
Do you know about the binary star system?

14:37.080 --> 14:38.210
Binary star system?

14:40.120 --> 14:43.870
It means two stars have their own orbits

14:44.340 --> 14:46.390
but revolve around the same center.

14:48.720 --> 14:50.700
Duan Qiyan and the rest are my buddies,

14:50.700 --> 14:53.270
but you're more like
my binary star partner.

14:54.910 --> 14:58.000
We'll move forward along different orbits,

14:59.510 --> 15:00.750
but our center will

15:01.480 --> 15:02.540
always be the same.

15:25.580 --> 15:27.980
The binary star system in astrophysics

15:28.170 --> 15:30.860
is a fascinating interstellar system.

15:32.050 --> 15:35.010
Two stars have their own orbits,

15:35.700 --> 15:37.860
revolving around the same center.

15:38.620 --> 15:39.940
They never conflict

15:40.740 --> 15:41.870
and never part ways.

15:43.170 --> 15:45.300
I also have my own binary star partner,

15:45.870 --> 15:48.870
so I'll never be lonely
in the vast universe.

15:50.620 --> 15:53.150
Thank you, my binary star partner,

15:54.120 --> 15:54.910
Jiang Yubai.

16:23.950 --> 16:25.070
What are you looking at,

16:25.070 --> 16:25.960
so absorbed?

16:28.460 --> 16:30.320
Look at these two little flowers.

16:34.790 --> 16:35.630
How special.

16:39.250 --> 16:41.050
On some random day, the two seeds

16:41.700 --> 16:43.700
must've been blown here by the wind.

16:45.150 --> 16:47.120
In this field of pink muhly grass,
they grew together

16:47.120 --> 16:48.080
towards the sun.

16:49.030 --> 16:51.290
This pink muhly field is like a universe.

16:52.150 --> 16:54.670
And these two are lives from afar,

16:55.410 --> 16:57.810
swaying together
in the long river of time.

16:59.270 --> 17:00.600
Don't they look like

17:00.770 --> 17:02.500
a perfect symbiotic function?

17:05.200 --> 17:06.329
Mutually dependent

17:07.530 --> 17:10.220
variables with
completely overlapping domains,

17:10.220 --> 17:12.030
where f(x, y) equals zero.

17:13.460 --> 17:16.260
Without either one,
this formula wouldn't exist.

17:17.770 --> 17:20.480
Using a formula to describe two flowers...

17:22.420 --> 17:23.480
is quite novel.

17:24.510 --> 17:26.240
I feel like all relationships

17:26.240 --> 17:28.099
can be expressed with functions.

17:28.290 --> 17:30.620
Friendship is like a composite function:

17:31.200 --> 17:33.160
you need me, and I need you;

17:33.720 --> 17:34.720
nested together,

17:35.110 --> 17:37.880
we jointly produce a more interesting

17:38.250 --> 17:39.680
and better range.

17:41.110 --> 17:43.680
A passing encounter
with a stranger is like

17:44.460 --> 17:46.320
a probability density function:

17:46.880 --> 17:49.290
at a certain point in time and space,

17:49.750 --> 17:52.480
the probability of our meeting
is no longer zero,

17:53.180 --> 17:55.040
and then quickly returns to zero.

18:01.030 --> 18:02.000
We...

18:02.830 --> 18:03.920
You two,

18:04.270 --> 18:05.030
stop chatting

18:05.030 --> 18:05.830
and come help!

18:06.330 --> 18:06.730
Hurry!

18:08.250 --> 18:08.780
Let's go.

18:10.680 --> 18:11.240
Coming.

18:17.380 --> 18:18.880
Jiang Yubai, come,

18:19.290 --> 18:20.350
help me with the table.

18:20.350 --> 18:21.030
Alright.

18:24.010 --> 18:26.310
Duan Qiyan and I will go
wash the pots and vegetables.

18:26.310 --> 18:27.880
He has too much energy anyway.
Let's go.

18:27.880 --> 18:28.680
Wait, wait.

18:29.250 --> 18:31.010
My delicate hands

18:31.010 --> 18:32.510
can't do that kind of work.

18:33.570 --> 18:35.300
Stop the nonsense and come now.

18:35.660 --> 18:37.030
Fine. Stop pulling me.

18:38.720 --> 18:40.590
Should I bring
the table and tableware over?

18:40.590 --> 18:41.270
Okay.

18:43.480 --> 18:45.750
Hey, bring the cassette stove over.

18:45.920 --> 18:46.720
I'll go get it.

18:47.510 --> 18:48.070
Okay.

18:57.660 --> 18:59.110
Why are you so bad at everything?

18:59.110 --> 19:00.870
Can't even wash vegetables properly?

19:00.870 --> 19:02.440
I didn't do it on purpose!

19:02.960 --> 19:04.330
If you think I'm stupid and ridiculous,

19:04.330 --> 19:05.590
then stay away from me!

19:10.630 --> 19:13.490
What's with that girl?
What did I do to deserve this?

19:14.790 --> 19:16.680
Attention, everyone.

19:17.270 --> 19:18.920
I think we can play a game.

19:19.010 --> 19:20.680
Only the winners of this game

19:21.180 --> 19:22.960
get to eat. How about it?

19:22.960 --> 19:23.750
What game?

19:23.810 --> 19:24.960
This game's very simple.

19:24.960 --> 19:26.290
I'll explain the rules.

19:26.510 --> 19:28.110
First, we'll close our eyes.

19:28.310 --> 19:30.000
I'll count down from 3,
and then we'll all

19:30.000 --> 19:31.640
open our eyes at the same time.

19:31.640 --> 19:33.100
If two people's eyes meet,

19:33.250 --> 19:36.310
they'll be the winners
of the round of the game.

19:36.330 --> 19:37.110
Of course,

19:37.400 --> 19:38.590
if a third person

19:38.590 --> 19:39.830
makes eye contact with

19:39.830 --> 19:41.270
either of you two,

19:41.660 --> 19:42.920
it won't count as a win.

19:43.510 --> 19:45.030
Alright, got it? It's very simple.

19:45.030 --> 19:45.880
You'd be a fool to not get it.

19:45.880 --> 19:46.720
Come on.

19:47.250 --> 19:48.780
Everyone, close your eyes.

19:49.550 --> 19:50.680
Okay, I got it.

19:50.680 --> 19:52.240
Yeah? Close your eyes.

19:52.400 --> 19:53.070
Right.

19:53.220 --> 19:54.550
Close your eyes. Good.

19:54.750 --> 19:56.480
3, 2, 1.

19:56.940 --> 19:57.800
Open your eyes!

20:02.090 --> 20:03.000
Wait.

20:04.110 --> 20:05.480
I looked at her.

20:05.480 --> 20:07.180
Right. Jiang looked at you, Zhixia.

20:07.180 --> 20:08.160
Again.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.510
T-This doesn't count as a win.

20:09.510 --> 20:10.960
Come on, again.

20:11.110 --> 20:12.110
Close your eyes.

20:12.570 --> 20:14.590
3, 2, 1.

20:14.920 --> 20:15.780
Open your eyes!

20:22.640 --> 20:23.310
Your eyes met?

20:23.310 --> 20:24.260
Yes, the two of us.

20:24.260 --> 20:25.960
Who did you look at?
You didn't look at them, right?

20:25.960 --> 20:26.510
Right, she didn't.

20:26.510 --> 20:27.240
Okay, you two won.

20:27.240 --> 20:27.920
You can eat!

20:27.920 --> 20:29.550
If we didn't see it,
that means we made eye contact.

20:29.550 --> 20:30.830
Yes. Go on, eat up.

20:31.700 --> 20:34.300
-They won. Let's continue.
-It smells so good!

20:35.050 --> 20:36.070
I'm so hungry.

20:36.290 --> 20:37.880
No use in complaining. Ignore them.

20:37.880 --> 20:38.880
We need to eat too.

20:39.240 --> 20:40.170
Close your eyes!

20:40.350 --> 20:41.480
3, 2, 1.

20:41.770 --> 20:42.630
Open your eyes!

20:44.290 --> 20:45.240
Our eyes met.

20:45.310 --> 20:46.640
I looked at Lin Zeqiu.

20:49.330 --> 20:50.830
Stop looking at him. What's there to see?

20:50.830 --> 20:52.400
You ruined our chance to eat!

20:52.400 --> 20:53.070
Again!

20:53.460 --> 20:55.030
Eat slowly. Leave some food for us.

20:55.030 --> 20:55.640
Come on.

20:55.640 --> 20:56.240
Come on.

20:56.290 --> 20:57.070
Close your eyes.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.070
3, 2, 1.

20:58.220 --> 20:58.830
Let's go!

21:03.400 --> 21:04.000
Yummy, right?

21:04.000 --> 21:04.590
Yummy.

21:06.000 --> 21:06.900
You looked at me, huh?

21:06.900 --> 21:07.790
Last round.

21:07.790 --> 21:08.550
I'm at my limit.

21:08.550 --> 21:10.480
-No, there must be winners.
-It's delicious.

21:10.480 --> 21:11.790
This game has no end.

21:11.790 --> 21:13.240
It has, for sure.

21:13.350 --> 21:14.750
Come on, close your eyes.

21:14.880 --> 21:15.960
3, 2, 1.

21:15.960 --> 21:16.820
Open your eyes!

21:19.570 --> 21:21.310
You two look at each other. Let's eat.

21:21.310 --> 21:22.030
Don't mind them.

21:22.030 --> 21:22.960
You two keep looking.

21:22.960 --> 21:23.880
I'll have one.

21:23.880 --> 21:25.030
Who wants some Coke?

21:25.030 --> 21:26.480
-Me, me!
-Me too.

21:26.500 --> 21:27.200
Slow down.

21:27.200 --> 21:28.460
Here, have a fishball.

21:29.720 --> 21:30.480
Thanks.

21:36.980 --> 21:39.400
Zeqiu... it's overflowing.

21:49.380 --> 21:50.590
Zeqiu, have one too.

21:51.850 --> 21:52.750
Delicious.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.200
Delicious.

21:56.200 --> 21:56.790
Then...

21:58.140 --> 22:00.070
g-give me one too.

22:02.180 --> 22:04.310
This fishball's r-really delicious.

22:05.380 --> 22:06.640
It has fish roe inside.

22:07.200 --> 22:08.000
Is it good?

22:08.000 --> 22:09.880
It's good. Try it while it's hot.

22:10.590 --> 22:11.310
Here.

22:11.900 --> 22:12.590
Thanks.

22:12.980 --> 22:14.640
-It's delicious.
-Thank you.

22:16.270 --> 22:17.270
It's nothing special.

22:17.270 --> 22:18.270
Give it to me then.

22:22.700 --> 22:23.440
It's so good.

22:26.810 --> 22:29.270
-Look at my jellyfish.
-Eat your jellyfish.

22:31.270 --> 22:34.480
This jellyfish took me a lot of effort.

22:36.960 --> 22:38.090
What are you doing?

22:38.090 --> 22:39.420
Tingting, are you full?

22:45.500 --> 22:46.760
Are you on a diet again?

22:47.380 --> 22:49.680
You've been dieting every day this year,

22:49.680 --> 22:51.160
but you're still the same.

22:52.090 --> 22:54.220
I'm not going to see the meteor shower.

22:55.900 --> 22:57.100
You all go without me.

23:03.290 --> 23:04.480
W-Wait, Tang,

23:04.640 --> 23:06.110
I was just joking.

23:06.500 --> 23:08.110
What I meant is

23:08.510 --> 23:10.590
your figure's already perfect.

23:10.590 --> 23:11.480
You're so thin.

23:11.480 --> 23:12.510
Why diet?

23:12.510 --> 23:13.960
You have no weight to lose.

23:13.960 --> 23:14.760
You're great.

23:14.880 --> 23:15.940
You're excellent.

23:16.050 --> 23:17.850
Duan Qiyan, shut up for a moment.

23:24.050 --> 23:24.920
What's wrong?

23:27.090 --> 23:28.030
Nothing.

23:28.380 --> 23:30.110
I just don't want to go anymore.

23:33.720 --> 23:35.780
Tingting, is something on your mind?

23:40.680 --> 23:42.200
I don't want to make a wish.

23:43.420 --> 23:44.590
Even if I make one,

23:44.900 --> 23:46.030
it won't come true.

23:47.180 --> 23:48.440
Why won't it come true?

23:49.680 --> 23:51.090
I want to go to Qingbei University,

23:51.090 --> 23:52.490
but I know I won't make it.

23:52.810 --> 23:54.550
So my wish won't come true.

23:55.200 --> 23:57.310
What if it affects your wishes too?

23:57.610 --> 23:59.210
I don't want to drag you down.

24:02.140 --> 24:04.270
What are you laughing at? I'm serious!

24:04.510 --> 24:06.370
I don't want to bring you bad luck.

24:09.090 --> 24:10.400
That's such a wild thought.

24:10.400 --> 24:11.660
Don't think like that.

24:14.070 --> 24:16.000
Tang, let me help you out with that.

24:16.580 --> 24:17.570
How about this?

24:17.570 --> 24:19.480
Don't wish for Qingbei.

24:19.640 --> 24:21.160
Wish for Zhendan.

24:22.240 --> 24:23.830
It's not like Qingbei is the only

24:23.830 --> 24:25.230
university in the world.

24:25.720 --> 24:27.110
Just wish for Zhendan.

24:27.310 --> 24:28.310
It will come true.

24:36.480 --> 24:39.310
Then when you all get into Qingbei,

24:39.310 --> 24:41.040
I'll be the only one at Zhendan.

24:42.220 --> 24:43.640
I'll drift further and further
away from you,

24:43.640 --> 24:45.300
and our friendship will fade.

24:45.420 --> 24:46.750
What if in the future,

24:47.110 --> 24:49.000
we completely lose touch?

24:51.880 --> 24:52.680
We won't.

24:54.590 --> 24:55.720
Didn't you say that

24:57.510 --> 24:59.680
we're friends filtered over time?

25:01.310 --> 25:02.350
You need us,

25:02.880 --> 25:03.940
and we need you too.

25:07.090 --> 25:09.110
Because of you,
we started listening to music,

25:09.110 --> 25:10.270
going to concerts,

25:10.570 --> 25:12.240
and doing lots of fun things.

25:12.920 --> 25:13.550
Yeah.

25:14.070 --> 25:16.330
We even did a performance because of you.

25:17.680 --> 25:19.880
These are wonderful memories we share.

25:19.900 --> 25:22.760
We won't drift apart
because of physical distance.

25:29.180 --> 25:29.880
Tang,

25:30.590 --> 25:31.450
think about it.

25:31.510 --> 25:33.510
We grew up together.

25:33.770 --> 25:35.170
Will our friendship fade

25:35.220 --> 25:36.880
just because we're apart

25:37.110 --> 25:38.510
for a mere four years?

25:40.350 --> 25:41.640
You're underestimating

25:41.640 --> 25:42.830
our friendship.

25:46.510 --> 25:47.940
We've been partners in crime

25:47.940 --> 25:49.460
since we were little.

25:49.850 --> 25:52.250
Once you graduate and come to Huacheng,

25:52.380 --> 25:54.380
I'll take you out to turn the place

25:54.380 --> 25:55.420
upside down.

25:56.510 --> 25:57.910
Who's your partner in crime?

25:57.910 --> 25:58.660
Get lost.

25:59.030 --> 25:59.810
Okay.

26:03.340 --> 26:04.750
He rolled into our tent.

26:05.420 --> 26:06.530
Rolled into the wrong place.

26:06.530 --> 26:07.920
Roll back here.

26:08.240 --> 26:09.100
Roll back here.

26:09.460 --> 26:10.520
I'm a little dizzy.

26:11.310 --> 26:12.270
Show-off.

26:13.940 --> 26:14.680
-Let's eat.
-Come on.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.830
Let's have a drink.

26:16.010 --> 26:17.000
To friendship.

26:17.140 --> 26:17.920
Come on.

26:17.950 --> 26:18.680
-Come on.
-Cheers!

26:18.680 --> 26:19.560
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

26:19.560 --> 26:20.470
Cheers!

26:20.490 --> 26:21.960
Cheers!

26:37.380 --> 26:38.040
I'm coming!

26:38.720 --> 26:39.580
Oh my goodness.

26:39.830 --> 26:40.720
I bounced up.

26:41.900 --> 26:43.900
Are you just bad at this or faking it?

26:47.960 --> 26:50.020
Why aren't you hanging out with them?

26:50.590 --> 26:52.030
Let me! I'll help you.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.360
They're so childish.

26:55.140 --> 26:56.160
Childish?

26:57.070 --> 26:58.400
Coming from you?

26:59.000 --> 27:00.600
Aren't you in the same class?

27:02.110 --> 27:04.310
Did you forget we're the same age?

27:06.350 --> 27:08.400
Right, we're the same age.

27:08.700 --> 27:09.310
I forgot.

27:12.180 --> 27:13.310
Look who's talking.

27:14.140 --> 27:15.030
You're just

27:15.030 --> 27:16.590
a year older than your sister.

27:16.590 --> 27:17.440
So worried about

27:17.440 --> 27:18.790
your sister coming out to play that

27:18.790 --> 27:19.920
you had to tag along?

27:21.270 --> 27:23.110
It's not that I don't trust her.

27:25.590 --> 27:26.920
Stand there in one spot.

27:26.940 --> 27:28.310
It's just that hanging out with you all

27:28.310 --> 27:29.480
is actually pretty fun.

27:29.480 --> 27:29.980
Start.

27:31.070 --> 27:33.200
Even though sometimes I don't join in,

27:34.590 --> 27:37.390
it's still pretty fun
just watching from the side.

27:53.880 --> 27:55.830
Actually, all my life,

27:55.830 --> 27:58.490
I've rarely participated
in group activities.

28:00.510 --> 28:01.590
But now I feel that

28:01.850 --> 28:03.310
as long as I stay with them,

28:03.730 --> 28:04.860
I'm very satisfied.

28:15.530 --> 28:16.480
Stop playing!

28:18.090 --> 28:19.030
Stop playing!

28:19.440 --> 28:20.500
Come back and help!

28:20.740 --> 28:21.720
Come down!

28:21.720 --> 28:23.200
Coming! Let's go.

28:32.240 --> 28:33.940
It's 9 PM. The meteor shower's coming.

28:33.940 --> 28:34.880
Let's guess who

28:35.200 --> 28:37.130
will spot the first shooting star.

28:37.290 --> 28:38.000
I predict

28:38.310 --> 28:40.550
I'll be the first to catch one.

28:41.090 --> 28:43.830
Stop guessing.
You suck but still love to compete.

28:43.830 --> 28:45.350
With your short attention span,

28:45.350 --> 28:46.810
you think you'll be first?

28:55.830 --> 28:56.790
Is that one?

28:58.330 --> 28:59.480
That's an airplane.

29:05.140 --> 29:06.030
Is that it?

29:06.450 --> 29:08.440
That's over the sea, Duan Qiyan.

29:08.580 --> 29:09.660
That's a lighthouse.

29:09.660 --> 29:11.720
Shooting stars don't look like that.

29:18.200 --> 29:19.010
What about that?

29:19.010 --> 29:20.350
That's a flying spark.

29:23.150 --> 29:25.180
Give it a rest.

29:26.120 --> 29:27.770
You almost set me on fire.

29:30.000 --> 29:31.640
Zeqiu, there hasn't been a shooting star.

29:31.640 --> 29:32.640
Are you stressed?

29:32.960 --> 29:34.720
I'm not stressed.

29:34.810 --> 29:37.590
You have to trust
your brother's professionalism.

29:37.590 --> 29:39.960
Besides, even weather forecasts
are wrong sometimes.

29:39.960 --> 29:41.890
Don't be anxious. Give it a minute.

29:47.330 --> 29:49.750
I remember when we watched them
at the astronomy club,

29:49.750 --> 29:52.650
there were usually
only one or two at first.

29:54.010 --> 29:55.400
But then they became meteor showers.

29:55.400 --> 29:56.380
Really stunning.

29:56.380 --> 29:57.240
Yeah.

29:57.720 --> 29:58.880
It hasn't reached

29:58.880 --> 30:01.000
the peak of the meteor shower yet.

30:01.330 --> 30:02.740
Waiting for a shooting star,

30:02.740 --> 30:04.000
you have to be sincere.

30:04.290 --> 30:06.890
Be truly sincere
from the bottom of your heart.

30:11.250 --> 30:12.440
Should we tell

30:12.440 --> 30:13.880
the shooting stars our wishes

30:13.880 --> 30:14.960
to summon them?

30:14.960 --> 30:16.720
I'll go first. I have one in mind.

30:16.720 --> 30:18.200
Lord Shooting Star!

30:18.660 --> 30:20.120
I want to get into Zhendan!

30:20.350 --> 30:22.680
I also want to become super pretty.

30:22.850 --> 30:24.480
And super rich.

30:25.160 --> 30:27.610
It'd be best if I could also
become Han Geng's manager.

30:27.610 --> 30:29.350
And I want to travel around the world!

30:29.350 --> 30:30.350
Hold it, hold it.

30:30.640 --> 30:33.020
Your self-introduction
is so long-winded, Tang.

30:33.020 --> 30:34.880
By then, your self-introduction

30:35.030 --> 30:37.110
will be famous Zhendan alumnus,

30:37.130 --> 30:39.130
beautiful, rich woman,

30:39.160 --> 30:42.270
and Han Geng's manager—Tang Tingting.

30:42.290 --> 30:44.150
Wait, there's an addendum:

30:44.450 --> 30:46.150
traveling around the world.

30:47.290 --> 30:48.510
Duan Qiyan,

30:48.980 --> 30:50.570
the shooting stars are watching.

30:50.570 --> 30:52.880
You'd better watch your mouth,

30:52.900 --> 30:54.300
or it might not bless you.

30:57.030 --> 30:58.620
Look at my big mouth.

30:58.980 --> 31:00.480
Um, Lord Shooting Star,

31:00.640 --> 31:03.340
I was just joking!

31:03.360 --> 31:06.160
Just showing off a bit of my own humor.

31:06.850 --> 31:07.680
Um,

31:07.700 --> 31:08.830
don't mind me.

31:12.200 --> 31:12.880
Hey,

31:12.960 --> 31:13.790
Zeqiu.

31:14.590 --> 31:15.480
Tell us

31:15.590 --> 31:17.160
how many shooting stars you can catch

31:17.160 --> 31:18.790
and what wishes you'll make.

31:18.790 --> 31:20.000
Catch shooting stars?

31:20.000 --> 31:20.960
Am I a cop?

31:24.590 --> 31:25.450
Shooting Star,

31:26.660 --> 31:27.880
I want to always

31:28.590 --> 31:30.650
be able to see the person I want to see.

31:32.650 --> 31:33.350
Who's that?

31:33.350 --> 31:34.310
Who's that?

31:35.290 --> 31:37.310
There are many people I want to see.

31:38.180 --> 31:39.160
Jin Baihui.

31:39.770 --> 31:40.830
What's your wish?

31:42.050 --> 31:42.960
I...

31:46.460 --> 31:47.960
Hello, Shooting Star!

31:48.570 --> 31:50.700
I want to be a little further from home!

31:58.200 --> 31:59.460
What's with that look?

32:00.250 --> 32:01.880
Isn't it good to be further from home?

32:01.880 --> 32:03.480
That way I can be with you all.

32:05.510 --> 32:07.080
I got into Qingbei.

32:07.110 --> 32:10.510
Surely my parents won't pressure me
to study anymore, right?

32:11.680 --> 32:12.480
That's right.

32:18.180 --> 32:19.000
Jiang Yubai,

32:19.200 --> 32:22.460
your shooting star can't hear you
if you just whisper to it.

32:28.700 --> 32:31.500
I want to go to Qingbei University
with Lin Zhixia.

32:40.050 --> 32:41.440
I'm not done yet, Zeqiu.

32:41.660 --> 32:45.120
I want to stargaze with Zeqiu.

32:45.410 --> 32:47.610
I also want to play ball with Duan Qiyan.

32:47.980 --> 32:50.240
I want to hit the library with Jin Baihui.

32:50.850 --> 32:52.110
And share life stories

32:52.310 --> 32:53.370
with Tang Tingting

32:53.660 --> 32:55.160
and Shen Fuxuan.

32:58.560 --> 33:01.830
Your wishes sound
so heartwarming and lovely.

33:05.790 --> 33:07.160
Maybe everyone thinks

33:07.900 --> 33:09.160
I have a lot of friends.

33:10.660 --> 33:11.720
But actually,

33:13.070 --> 33:17.130
I've been constantly transferring schools
and changing environments,

33:17.900 --> 33:21.360
often parting ways right after
getting to know my classmates.

33:21.500 --> 33:23.590
I haven't had any deep friendships.

33:26.700 --> 33:27.480
So,

33:28.380 --> 33:30.180
I'm very glad to have met you all.

33:33.700 --> 33:35.920
Zeqiu and I had a rough start.

33:36.660 --> 33:39.310
At that time, I thought
he was bullying Lin Zhixia.

33:39.310 --> 33:41.370
I didn't expect him to be her brother.

33:44.310 --> 33:45.640
Duan Qiyan, Jin Baihui.

33:45.880 --> 33:48.050
If it weren't for
the competition prep with you,

33:48.050 --> 33:49.850
I'd never have fought to the end.

33:52.050 --> 33:54.350
Tang Tingting, if it weren't for you,

33:54.810 --> 33:58.610
I really wouldn't have had the chance
to help the police solve a case.

34:01.390 --> 34:03.850
And to Shen Fuxuan,
who's far away overseas:

34:04.380 --> 34:05.580
if it weren't for you,

34:06.460 --> 34:07.960
I wouldn't have known that so many people

34:07.960 --> 34:09.489
would have my back that day.

34:12.860 --> 34:14.920
The most important one is Lin Zhixia.

34:17.570 --> 34:18.480
We went through

34:19.150 --> 34:21.480
many important moments in life together.

34:24.630 --> 34:26.090
Maybe even you don't know,

34:26.760 --> 34:28.159
but it's because I met you

34:28.500 --> 34:29.830
that I could have so many

34:30.170 --> 34:32.250
wonderful stories and beautiful bonds

34:32.250 --> 34:33.510
with everyone.

34:35.210 --> 34:36.469
And because of you all,

34:38.170 --> 34:40.550
my night sky has become even brighter.

34:41.380 --> 34:42.150
So...

34:49.730 --> 34:50.920
What are those?

34:53.150 --> 34:54.190
I made these yesterday

34:54.190 --> 34:56.250
using petals from the sea of flowers.

34:56.360 --> 34:58.840
In case we don't see
a shooting star today,

34:59.150 --> 35:00.610
it can serve as a keepsake.

35:00.940 --> 35:02.870
This way, when everyone sees this,

35:02.980 --> 35:05.580
it'll feel as if
we're right next to each other.

35:07.490 --> 35:08.550
And each bottle contains

35:08.550 --> 35:09.650
a different flower,

35:09.650 --> 35:10.960
each conveying a different meaning.

35:10.960 --> 35:11.920
I won't elaborate.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.720
Look it up yourselves when you go back.

35:13.720 --> 35:14.500
Here.

35:16.500 --> 35:17.390
Yours, Duan Qiyan.

35:17.390 --> 35:18.230
Thanks.

35:18.400 --> 35:20.400
-Tang Tingting, yours.
-Thank you.

35:21.670 --> 35:22.510
Jin Baihui, yours.

35:22.510 --> 35:23.280
Thank you.

35:27.760 --> 35:28.480
Zeqiu.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.190
This is yours.

35:37.760 --> 35:39.000
So pretty.

35:39.050 --> 35:40.020
What's yours?

35:40.050 --> 35:41.400
It even has my name.

35:45.940 --> 35:46.740
Maple leaves?

35:47.650 --> 35:49.980
-Pink flowers.
-What's yours? Let me see.

35:51.940 --> 35:53.470
It's already 9:30 PM.

35:53.740 --> 35:55.670
About time a shooting star appear.

35:57.000 --> 35:57.730
I don't know.

35:58.590 --> 36:00.440
Will we get to see one tonight?

36:01.960 --> 36:02.590
It's okay.

36:02.760 --> 36:04.510
Why don't we play something,

36:04.510 --> 36:05.190
or...

36:06.550 --> 36:07.800
does anyone have snacks?

36:07.800 --> 36:08.670
I'm hungry.

36:08.670 --> 36:09.760
I have some food here.

36:09.760 --> 36:10.400
I have some.

36:10.400 --> 36:12.130
There are snacks here. Come on.

36:12.690 --> 36:14.030
I'll add some firewood!

36:17.000 --> 36:18.380
Maybe after today,

36:19.110 --> 36:21.130
we'll never be in the same city anymore.

36:19.810 --> 36:25.480
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

36:22.400 --> 36:24.730
We might not see each other
for a long time.

36:26.030 --> 36:28.190
Everyone traveled a long, long way

36:26.920 --> 36:32.710
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

36:29.030 --> 36:30.630
just to make a wish upon you.

36:31.920 --> 36:34.360
Please don't leave everyone with regrets.

36:33.890 --> 36:39.430
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

36:37.590 --> 36:39.780
Please, you must appear.

36:40.860 --> 36:46.670
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

36:41.630 --> 36:42.550
Please.

36:43.690 --> 36:44.320
This one!

36:44.320 --> 36:45.320
It's super yummy.

36:45.690 --> 36:46.440
Let me see.

36:46.800 --> 36:48.330
Why's there so little left?

36:49.160 --> 36:55.460
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

36:50.960 --> 36:51.840
What's that?

36:53.460 --> 36:54.550
-A shooting star!
-A shooting star!

36:54.550 --> 36:55.880
Shooting stars! Hurry!

36:55.880 --> 36:57.550
-Hurry! Hurry!
-Shooting stars!

36:56.070 --> 37:01.660
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

36:57.800 --> 36:58.730
Shooting stars!

36:59.050 --> 37:00.190
Hurry, hurry!

37:00.190 --> 37:00.840
Shooting stars! Shooting stars!

37:00.840 --> 37:01.670
Hurry, hurry!

37:01.670 --> 37:02.550
Shooting stars!

37:02.460 --> 37:05.300
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

37:02.940 --> 37:04.190
They're so beautiful.

37:04.190 --> 37:05.050
So pretty.

37:06.030 --> 37:08.950
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

37:09.460 --> 37:11.700
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

37:12.110 --> 37:15.770
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

37:16.580 --> 37:19.070
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

37:17.500 --> 37:18.560
Right, make a wish!

37:18.630 --> 37:19.710
Make a wish now!

37:19.890 --> 37:22.660
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

37:20.150 --> 37:21.780
Make one for Shen Fuxuan first.

37:21.780 --> 37:23.110
May our friendship

37:23.300 --> 37:25.360
-last forever!
-Last forever!

37:23.390 --> 37:25.950
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

37:25.710 --> 37:26.880
One more, hurry!

37:26.580 --> 37:29.890
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

37:27.460 --> 37:28.120
Make a wish.

37:30.500 --> 37:32.150
Huacheng, here I come!

37:30.810 --> 37:33.750
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

37:32.360 --> 37:35.550
When I get there, I will make my mark!

37:34.350 --> 37:37.000
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

37:36.090 --> 37:37.400
There's no time.
Everyone make your own wish.

37:37.400 --> 37:38.400
Hurry!

37:37.640 --> 37:43.530
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

37:41.530 --> 37:43.820
I want to take good care
of the people around me,

37:43.820 --> 37:46.150
especially my parents
and my little sister.

37:44.030 --> 37:44.930
♪ Myself ♪

37:45.190 --> 37:47.030
♪ Draw near to you ♪

37:47.510 --> 37:50.320
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

37:48.980 --> 37:50.590
Oh heavens, all gods and immortals,

37:50.590 --> 37:52.610
please bless me so I don't fall behind.

37:50.890 --> 37:53.240
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

37:53.570 --> 37:57.210
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

37:57.860 --> 38:01.030
I hope I can truly be myself one day.

37:58.010 --> 38:00.550
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

38:01.360 --> 38:04.090
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

38:04.780 --> 38:07.370
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

38:05.590 --> 38:08.340
I, Duan Qiyan,
must make my mark in Huacheng.

38:07.950 --> 38:11.150
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

38:09.860 --> 38:11.120
I hope there comes a day

38:11.460 --> 38:12.780
when Lin Zhixia understands...

38:12.230 --> 38:15.210
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

38:15.800 --> 38:18.440
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

38:19.090 --> 38:26.250
♪ The rarest blessing in life
is a sweet dream ♪

38:27.630 --> 38:30.010
♪ That never ends ♪

38:29.090 --> 38:30.620
Are you done making wishes?

38:30.690 --> 38:31.880
I suggest

38:32.070 --> 38:33.870
we take a group photo right here,

38:33.880 --> 38:35.510
leaving a spot for Shen,

38:35.510 --> 38:36.960
to mark our visit.

38:37.070 --> 38:37.820
-Okay.
-Okay!

38:37.820 --> 38:38.950
I'll get the camera.

38:39.840 --> 38:40.840
It's counting down. Hurry.

38:40.840 --> 38:42.670
Come on. 3, 2, 1.

39:00.830 --> 39:03.120
[Intercity Bus:
Xiaochongshan to Ougang]

39:15.820 --> 39:17.210
Get your luggage!

39:17.210 --> 39:19.000
Don't you want to learn skateboarding?

39:19.000 --> 39:20.330
I'll take you tomorrow.

39:20.670 --> 39:21.380
Sure.

39:22.730 --> 39:24.190
But I'm afraid of falling.

39:24.690 --> 39:26.280
I'll borrow protective gear for you,

39:26.280 --> 39:27.810
so it won't hurt if you fall.

39:29.400 --> 39:31.260
Come find me early tomorrow.

39:37.380 --> 39:38.640
Keep the emerald safe.

39:41.300 --> 39:42.760
Thank you for the emerald.

39:48.570 --> 39:52.610
[Ougang City
Public Security Bureau Summons]

39:57.960 --> 39:59.170
Your P2P lending

39:59.170 --> 40:00.050
has collapsed.

40:00.880 --> 40:02.860
The boss of the head office has run away.

40:02.860 --> 40:04.060
What about the money?

40:04.530 --> 40:05.460
They took it all.

40:06.230 --> 40:07.560
Over 2 billion in total.

40:08.460 --> 40:09.530
They took it all?

40:09.900 --> 40:10.610
Yes.

40:11.840 --> 40:13.440
Just the amount sold from you

40:13.860 --> 40:15.090
is over 2.2 million.

40:16.880 --> 40:19.710
2,276,500.

40:20.380 --> 40:22.840
You can't escape joint criminal liability.

40:24.320 --> 40:25.900
And your final sentence

40:26.780 --> 40:30.300
still depends on how cooperative you are
with our investigation.

40:30.300 --> 40:32.700
You must actively return all illegal gains

40:33.300 --> 40:34.500
and try your best

40:34.500 --> 40:36.760
to compensate all the clients
under your name for their losses.

40:36.760 --> 40:38.490
Try to earn their forgiveness.

40:59.820 --> 41:00.460
Hello?

41:02.690 --> 41:03.380
Hello?

41:04.030 --> 41:04.890
Say something.

41:05.480 --> 41:06.280
What's wrong?

41:07.780 --> 41:09.580
Did something happen to our son?

41:10.670 --> 41:11.050
No.

41:11.050 --> 41:12.170
Our son's fine.

41:12.170 --> 41:12.630
It's...

41:13.320 --> 41:14.730
I-It's me.

41:17.280 --> 41:17.980
I...

41:18.780 --> 41:20.840
I need to discuss something with you.

41:21.750 --> 41:23.440
What is it? Go on.

41:33.050 --> 41:33.780
Can...

41:35.670 --> 41:36.650
Can you...

41:38.760 --> 41:41.340
lend me two million?

41:43.430 --> 41:45.030
I was cheated by the company.

41:46.110 --> 41:47.110
The boss ran away.

41:52.690 --> 41:54.210
It's too much, right?

41:55.090 --> 41:56.230
Never mind. It's fine.

41:56.230 --> 41:56.900
Then...

41:57.550 --> 41:58.670
one million is also fine.

41:58.670 --> 41:59.730
Or even less.

42:00.400 --> 42:01.900
500... 500,000, okay?

42:01.940 --> 42:03.170
500,000 works too.

42:03.800 --> 42:04.800
Anything's fine.

42:06.840 --> 42:07.570
Guan Xunmei,

42:08.590 --> 42:10.250
I haven't had time to tell you,

42:10.500 --> 42:13.080
but all my money is
tied up in real estate.

42:13.340 --> 42:14.740
My company went bust too.

42:14.940 --> 42:16.270
I really can't help you.

42:17.590 --> 42:19.760
Do you need me to take our son?

42:20.360 --> 42:21.980
But in my current situation,

42:22.170 --> 42:24.100
it's really hard for me to take him.

42:37.900 --> 42:39.700
-Let's go home for dinner.
-Bye.

42:39.860 --> 42:40.980
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

42:40.980 --> 42:41.980
See you tomorrow.

42:42.090 --> 42:43.090
See you tomorrow.

42:43.440 --> 42:44.130
Bye-bye.

42:49.990 --> 42:52.870
[5 missed calls from Mom]

43:10.500 --> 43:11.300
Mom.

43:12.440 --> 43:13.780
Why are the lights off?

43:16.150 --> 43:17.210
I called you back later.

43:17.210 --> 43:18.470
Why didn't you answer?

43:21.690 --> 43:22.380
Mom?

43:29.280 --> 43:29.960
Mom!

44:04.110 --> 44:07.440
When I waved and told Jiang Yubai
I'd see him tomorrow,

44:08.780 --> 44:10.230
I thought I was just solving

44:10.230 --> 44:12.030
a math problem with clear steps.

44:12.630 --> 44:15.190
"See you tomorrow" was a constant.

44:16.710 --> 44:18.570
I'd see him like I always did.

44:19.400 --> 44:21.550
We'd do many things together.

44:21.920 --> 44:24.050
We'd see each other millions of times.

44:29.280 --> 44:31.140
But after I grew up, I learned that

44:32.050 --> 44:33.710
encounters between people

44:34.130 --> 44:35.590
aren't linear equations.

44:37.000 --> 44:39.780
There are no fixed slopes and intercepts.

44:40.690 --> 44:44.510
They're more like points scattered
at random, governed by probability.

44:44.510 --> 44:45.690
Every reunion

44:46.500 --> 44:48.590
takes a great deal of luck.

44:51.340 --> 44:54.610
And my luck seems to have run out.

44:56.460 --> 44:57.610
After that parting,

44:58.670 --> 45:00.510
my best friend, Jiang Yubai...

45:02.570 --> 45:04.840
disappeared from my world again.
